type: software
title: "Iran Flood Watch: ensemble flood early warning for Iran"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
authors:
  - family-names: Abbasalizadehrezaei
    given-names: Parisa
    website: "https://risarezaei.github.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RisaRezaei/iran-flood-watch"
url: "https://risarezaei.github.io/iran-flood-watch/"
license-url: "https://github.com/RisaRezaei/iran-flood-watch/blob/main/LICENSE"
abstract: >-
  Flood early-warning dashboard for Iran covering 29 river reaches and
  27 flash-flood-prone cities. River warnings compare GloFAS ensemble
  discharge forecasts (51 members, 30 days) with Gumbel return levels of the
  model's own climate. Flash-flood warnings combine seven global ensembles
  (ECMWF IFS and AIFS, Google WeatherNext 2, NOAA GEFS, DWD ICON-EPS,
  ECCC GEPS, Met Office MOGREPS-G; 276 members) against ERA5 1-day and 3-day
  return levels, with a second check for rain on wet ground and snowmelt.
  Alerts state people at risk and advice in English and Persian and are
  published as CAP 1.2 messages and RSS.
keywords:
  - flood early warning
  - Iran
  - GloFAS
  - ECMWF ensemble
  - flash floods
  - return period
